			"entries": [
				"You summon forth the power of space to obliterate your foes. You gather cosmic power around yourself, and fire a beam of pure spatial matter 100 feet long and 5 feet wide which blasts out from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the line must make a Constitution saving throw. A creature takes {@damage 4d6} bludgeoning damage and {@damage 4d6} radiant damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one."
